WEBVTT

00:27:57.996 --> 00:28:01.538
value. In other words, they
were less likely to cheat,

00:28:01.829 --> 00:28:04.371
which is possibly the opposite
of what you'd expect from

00:28:04.371 --> 00:28:06.329
a person who came of age while struggling.

00:28:06.829 --> 00:28:10.288
The people who tend to cheat are actually
the people who are doing really well.

00:28:10.621 --> 00:28:14.954
A lot of cheating comes from entitlement
or a belief that somebody deserves

00:28:14.954 --> 00:28:17.746
a better outcome or that nobody
will notice. And I'll get a.

00:28:19.538 --> 00:28:22.079
So when you look into your crystal ball,
then I don't

00:28:22.079 --> 00:28:23.079
want one of those,

00:28:23.788 --> 00:28:26.704
I beg to differ based on
your findings in 20

00:28:26.704 --> 00:28:30.621
or 30 years when people who are just
starting out their career become CEOs.